[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9720.11, "timestamp": "02:42:00", "text": "像教堂一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9724.469, "timestamp": "02:42:04", "text": "pe。我必须保留显示器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.51, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "嗯。因为我的力量，呃，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.309, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "它？那个眼睛状的东西当时正在……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.63, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "大幅增加。所以我不得不远离。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9736.63, "timestamp": "02:42:16", "text": "显示器就在我脸旁边。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9740.23, "timestamp": "02:42:20", "text": "就保持这样吧，因为我看到其他专业人士也这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9742.63, "timestamp": "02:42:22", "text": "还有一些事情，我当时就想，“哦，所以你可以……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9746.79, "timestamp": "02:42:26", "text": "瞄准得更好，或者像看到每个人一样正确地看清。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9749.429, "timestamp": "02:42:29", "text": "如果你凑得很近仔细看，就会看到那样的景象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9751.91, "timestamp": "02:42:31", "text": "到显示器之类的。” 哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.389, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "但它对眼睛也不好。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9759.349, "timestamp": "02:42:39", "text": "是的。是的。这是。是真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9761.59, "timestamp": "02:42:41", "text": "等等，所以你戴眼镜，对吧？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9764.469, "timestamp": "02:42:44", "text": "你的眼镜就像……就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9766.63, "timestamp": "02:42:46", "text": "类似蓝光过滤之类的东西。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9769.429, "timestamp": "02:42:49", "text": "是的。它确实有这个功能。它确实有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9772.23, "timestamp": "02:42:52", "text": "那。是的。因为我感觉像有光……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9773.67, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "text": "它叫什么？我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9776.07, "timestamp": "02:42:56", "text": "畏光症。是的。是的。所以，就像"}]